OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew laser treatment introduced at
OL,4,ASurrey hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new laser treatment to slow the
OL,7,Fprogression of glaucoma has been
OL,8,Fintroduced at a hospital in Surrey.
OL,10,FThe innovative new technique, which is
OL,11,Fbeing performed at Frimley Park
OL,12,FHospital, near Camberley, uses laser
OL,13,Flight energy to reduce the pressure in
OL,14,Fthe eye and impede further vision loss.
OL,16,FTaking just minutes to perform and
OL,17,Fusually carried out at the same time as
OL,18,Fcataract surgery, it can last years and
OL,19,Fleave around 80% of mild to moderate
OL,20,Fcases medication-free within 12 months.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
