OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew laser treatment introduced at
OL,4,ASurrey hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FMishank Jain, a consultant
OL,7,Fophthalmologist from Frimley Health NHS
OL,8,FFoundation Trust, said: "Although
OL,9,Fglaucoma has no cure, early treatment
OL,10,Fcan prevent it developing to the point
OL,11,Fwhere more complex surgery is needed."
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
